    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c208d8a3ec150481d8993b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望您能再一次下定决心。\n为了和我，一起走向遥远的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "703af44d5da97d5ab7d86809273b25c74531ea72f23f84396eb27d20f13a4ef0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        107,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/107/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bd9ef8c645515a7bc5e715",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛那一夜重现一般，\n心脏炽热地搏动着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a892423ca1748a727b7c6a15ca055ef3a0b9d410676365296229e6045ca0dcf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        108,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/108/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c3d524b7a12a505365cbbca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一定会，让西沙里奥成为未来的“基石”――\n与她一同追逐梦想，这样的故事就此揭幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ea3b04e79d6db61b67170a2561a8ac532b20210c85ca801b2e75423171ad53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        109,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/109/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82faafb474dda42ed311574",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "打起精神，\n正赶往训练员室时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "870c7eeaf6018c8bb2a7dd0a66459e28d7fa9c51c3fbdff0cce2eaf5e65cfe58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
