    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edebccba197ebf60b418bf47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，就从莱茵开始吧。\n怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ea777723dc7d708ad0bfed637a2b384c211ec46b65e197c92bc0290a748090",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de67773482420c4c2f96fe50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥和三名同级生在一起。首先是\n『莱茵力量』。西沙里奥的挚友，\n憧憬后冠路线的开朗赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5af971f96a5498e82c1c62d5efaf5bf2ace09775c09ee2c8e3e13908a97915",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edc83f41c9b784b6d09ea83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc0478397dddaf29860878e611e32a8803c3deb73f318f6dbdfb06a653d53cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
