    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6a460f88fea2b3f167e814",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过不过，\n气槽前辈的『橡树大赛』也很好，\n菱亚马逊前辈的『有马纪念』也……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f365c8caae9bfd28d526d31c67c531ae63a9ceb9ab882601ef4c83cf3440128",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
