      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了展示其实力，\n从美国而来的强势赛马娘\n『勇敢之心』。然后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ed6421acfbfe22e89852fc64eca61a78307539018b40222d3460040669528c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
