      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是个认真严谨的赛马娘，比任何人都敬重\n曾在后冠路线大放异彩的母亲『\n』空中救世主。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc0c281284b29cd066a4e980ccdcef84520981b16d0039a9898a0c54e3831bdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
